<!--
Alternative to CLAUDE.md.example for anyone who prefers instruction lines over
@-imports. Same effect, but the referenced files are read on demand rather than
inlined into every session's context.

Copy to ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md and replace /ABS/PATH/TO/ai-agent-skills with your
local clone path. Keep only the lines you want.
-->

At session start, read /ABS/PATH/TO/ai-agent-skills/shared/references/agent-runtime/DEVELOPER_INSTRUCTIONS.md, /ABS/PATH/TO/ai-agent-skills/shared/references/agent-runtime/DOC_MAP.md and /ABS/PATH/TO/ai-agent-skills/claude/EXECUTION_MODEL.md before running commands or drafting anything for the user.
At session start, read /ABS/PATH/TO/ai-agent-skills/shared/references/branch-context/BRANCH_CONTEXT.md before running commands or drafting anything for the user.
